============================================================
1. OVERALL OBJECTIVE
============================================================

The Power BI dashboard monitors Airflow/MWAA DAG execution from an
operational/support perspective.

There are two major categories:

1. Daily / operational DAGs
2. Periodic DAGs

The Daily page is already working.

The current task is ONLY the Periodic Dashboard.

The Periodic Dashboard needs to monitor DAGs that run on schedules such as:

- Weekly
- Monthly
- Quarterly
- Other periodic schedules
- DAGs triggered through Master DAG branch logic

The primary purpose of the Periodic Dashboard is to answer:

"For each periodic DAG, what is its expected execution cycle, when did it
last run, what is its current status for the relevant cycle, and when is
the next expected cycle?"

